<title>USA: Loral to sell $600 mln of convertible prfd.</title>
<headline>Loral to sell $600 mln of convertible prfd.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loral Space &amp; Communications Ltd said Friday that it has agreed to sell $600 million of six percent convertible preferred equivalent obligations due 2006. The figure includes the exercise of over-allotment option.</p>
<p>The securities will be convertible into common shares at $20 per share, a premium of 25.9 percent over Thursday's closing at 15-7/8, the company said.</p>
